WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
1 / Decompress   →   2 / Bubbles expand
As pressure drops, dissolved gas forms bubbles. Bubbles expand while lava is still mobile.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
3 / Vesicles preserved in solid rock
The gas cavities stay behind after the surrounding lava freezes.
